    Bug 1994579 - Stop sending browsing context IDs across actors. r=dandarnell

    Passing around browsing context IDs was unnecessary and relied on a function which is no longer
    there. This patch uses the available browsing context instead.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D268814

